Query

To show informations about a building use this tool and click on the Building in question.

The information is shown in the lower right corner, instead of the minimap.

Press 'g' to show underground information. 'm' and 'n' cycle through optional pages. Alternatively use the right mouse key.

There are no costs to use this tool.

IMG_1[Query:]: images/gui/buttonpanel/base/pointer.png

